---
description: Hard separation between design, architecture, implementation, and human approval.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Agent roles

- Design Agent: static mockups only under `docs/design/mockups/**`.
- Architecture Agent: specifications and plans; no application code or tests.
- Implementation Agent: approved code, tests, and observed evidence; no silent re-architecture.
- Human: Feature RD approval, exceptions, external actions, and production authority.

Use separate worktrees or clones for concurrent agents.

